// Grown elder: a giant of the Grown, the outer reach's boss (GDR-0027, GDR-0099 A7, GDR-0103), at a site of its own
// at the end of a trail (`trails.ron`'s `elder_grove`), never a gate's guardian. Two ram prows out in front, eight
// thorn guns a row back, two hearts in a deep hide of tissue, three ganglions (24 MW for eight guns and six
// thrusters, 24 MW). PLACEHOLDER layout (lead default, 18 Oct 2026).
